## 10. Verify the integration before using it as a release gate

Use owner-approved controlled cases or existing execution evidence. The private integration must have an inspectable result for each case.

| Case | Expected behavior |
|---|---|
| Request lacks a required field | Validation reports the error before the configured cloud operation. |
| App/test package pair is wrong | The preparation or execution result fails explicitly. |
| Native test-package reference is missing | The required native suite remains incomplete. |
| A required chicken-order assertion fails | Test failure is visible in Sauce Labs and the required Bitrise result. |
| No tests are discovered or a required suite is skipped | The required device gate remains incomplete. |
| Device allocation or backend access fails | Infrastructure failure is reported with the actual session evidence. |
| Notification/upload response becomes unknown | Existing identities are preserved and remote state is reconciled before another write. |
| Test failure occurs before evidence collection | The original failure remains visible while the approved collector handles available diagnostics. |
| Android passes and iOS fails | Both platform outcomes remain visible independently. |

Only mark the device gate passed after the required suites complete for the intended packages and matrix. Coverage, security assessment, release signing, and destination availability have their own required results.

## If a step fails

| Symptom | Next action |
|---|---|
| Credentials rejected | Ask the authorized owner to inspect account, region, binding, and permissions. |
| Request YAML rejected | Validate against the pinned private app-create schema and exact input/path. |
| Application cannot launch | Inspect package type, native identity, signing compatibility, and required runtime configuration. |
| Runner/test package is missing | Inspect the actual producer and its output/storage mapping. |
| Device remains queued | Inspect account concurrency, availability, and approved device criteria. |
| No required tests execute | Confirm test target, instrumentation runner/scheme, class filters, and package pairing. |
| Test result is pending or timed out | Inspect the exact session and completion behavior before another dispatch. |
| Bitrise passes despite failed required tests | Inspect the private step's exit/result handling and pipeline failure configuration. |
| Upload outcome is unknown | Preserve the request/package identity and reconcile remote state before another upload. |

